        "content": "**Reading export health**\n\nThe panels in this row surface *intermittent* OTLP export failures (e.g. occasional collector hiccups) via `pa_monitor_otel_export_attempts_total{outcome=\"failure\"}` and the export-duration histogram.\n\nA **total** export outage does NOT show up as a rising failure rate here — instead it appears as:\n\n- a scrape gap in these panels (no new samples land), and\n- the `UNHEALTHY` line the daemon writes to stderr.\n\nCheck both signals together."
      }
    }
  ]
}
